## Era stories (facts to keep)

**design** — Visual design and front-end for clinics, food brands, small businesses. **Vale Telecom 2018** cluster (still under design era until years list): Folha do Comércio, Metasita, Lagoa Silvana, Damasceno, ACDN, Nina Cordeiro, Via Prime. Engrenha+ = most recent institutional client (craft bar: SEO, responsive, light/dark). VIP Produções = adolescence client. Jardim da Vitória (Pix/RSVP). Victoria’s Photo Shoot PWA.

**hardware** — SENAI = **Computer Networks** técnico (DNS/DHCP/servers) — mechatronics was interest, not the course. Bachelor’s = **Faculdade Única** / Magic Globe. Magic Globe dates: **Dec 2018** bet → first prototype **May 2019** → final **Nov 2019** → TCC approved **Dec 2019** (PDF in assets). EN "Magic Globe" / PT "Globo Mágico"; Live `https://isaque.it/cubo/`. Metaphor: find structure under noise.

**ideyou** — Pandemic 2020 origin with friend **Tainan** (Warface 2013): closed WhatsApp quality group → ~5 → informal company (not incorporated). Multi-service: web, bots, ads, graphic, video, branding. Large client circle includes **Integra Foods** (~2020/2021 SP distributor industry↔restaurants; WhatsApp bot, LPs, e-commerce, ads, graphic, video/explainer, branding; ERP talks as scope grew — founders already clients via Saint Germain / Spa Água Santa circle), **Saint Germain**, **Spa Água Santa**. Partnership ended over quality/reputation vs sales expectations; transitioned brand to **isaque.it** (evolution, not revenge rebrand). Public site: lead with evolution/values — do not put cast drama on the portfolio. MioDelivery (LM Salgados since 2017). Saint Germain delivery control (canhoto/PWA, scan.it lineage). Meu Aurélio (2023, João Paulo II — prefer **teaching** era in catalog).

**teaching** — CS teaching while building school relationships. **Meu Aurélio** (2023): lesson-plan PDF + QR materials. **CTI**: Coordinator of Technical Computing at Escola João Paulo II **since Feb 2026**, and still teacher. CTI Projects = public hub of student work.

**platform** — Convergence under isaque.it: sistema, api, cliente, notify.it, barcode.it, **scan.it**, print.it. Same care as early design sites, at platform scale.

